# TAN-SIP A/B order 7 with EVERY term 2 <= p+q <= 7 set on both
# axes (synthetic, gen_highorder_cases.py). Coefficient of u^p v^q:
# s * c / 1024^(p+q) with c = 0.8 px (A) or 0.6 px (B) and
# s = (1 + 0.11 p + 0.07 q), sign (-1)^(p+q) for A and (-1)^p for B, so
# every term moves the chip corner (1024 px from CRPIX on both axes) by
# 0.6-1.9 px: a dropped or swapped order-6+ term is visible. No AP/BP:
# sky -> pixel inverts A/B numerically.
# TOL_PX: see gen_highorder_cases.py.
TOL_PX 1e-8
NOTE pipeline: SIP order 7, every A/B term set (high-order SIP)
GRID 1 2048 9 1 2048 9
PIX 1024.5 1024.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 2048
NAXIS2  = 2048
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN-SIP'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN-SIP'
CRVAL1  = 210.80227
CRVAL2  = 54.34895
CRPIX1  = 1024.5
CRPIX2  = 1024.5
CD1_1   = -2.8E-04
CD1_2   = 1.5E-06
CD2_1   = 1.2E-06
CD2_2   = 2.8E-04
A_ORDER = 7
